==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Lairon|122}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion; both cards have the Lunge Out attack.
*'''Lunge Out''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Makuhita|56}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
